b. counselors in the field of health; and
e. counselors in the field of psychology.
(3) Implementation of counseling carried out by counselors may be implemented in a networked manner as follows:
a. counseling in the field of law by involving the police, prosecutor's office, district court, religious court, legal advocacy institutions and Non-Governmental Organizations;
